  "date": "2026-11-07",
  "category": "finance",
  "title_zh": "美国10月新增就业16.5万人，高于预期",
  "title_en": "US adds 165,000 jobs in October, above expectations",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "zh": "美国劳工统计局11月6日（星期五）公布了10月的就业数据。10月非农就业新增16.5万人，经济学家事先预测的数字是6.5万人。",
      "en": "On November 6 (Friday), the US Bureau of Labor Statistics released its October jobs data. Nonfarm employment rose by 165,000 in October; the number economists had predicted beforehand was 65,000."
    },
    {
      "zh": "美国10月的失业率是4.1%，比上个月低0.1个百分点。工人的平均时薪比上个月增长0.4%，比去年同期增长3.1%。",
      "en": "The US unemployment rate in October was 4.1%, 0.1 percentage points lower than the month before. Workers' average hourly pay rose 0.4% from the previous month and 3.1% from a year earlier."
    },
    {
      "zh": "8月和9月的数据也有调整：8月上调到18.6万人，9月上调到6万人。两个月合计比原来多了8.4万人。",
      "en": "The August and September figures were also revised: August was raised to 186,000 and September to 60,000. Together, the two months are 84,000 higher than before."
    },
    {
      "zh": "美联储上周把基准利率保持在3.75%到4.00%。数据公布后，期货市场显示，12月加息25个基点的概率约为80%，公布前约为75%。美国10月的消费者物价指数将在下周二（10日）公布。",
      "en": "Last week the Federal Reserve kept its benchmark interest rate at 3.75% to 4.00%. After the data came out, futures markets showed about an 80% probability of a 25-basis-point rate hike in December, versus about 75% before the release. The US consumer price index for October will be released next Tuesday (the 10th)."
    }
  ],
